# Test case 7: Sink in helper's loop condition
# Issue: leak-summary traversal omits sink effects in loop conditions
# Expected: COMPILE ERROR - sink in loop condition/effect summary is missing from leak check
# Status: CURRENTLY FAILS (accepts code that should be rejected)

функ helper(p) требует [ДоступСети] {
    пусть count = 0
    пока p > 0 {
        сеть.отправить(0)
        count = count + 1
    }
    вернуть count
}

функ старт() требует [ДоступСети] {
    вернуть helper(среда.секрет())
}
